---
import Side from './Side.astro';
import Top from './Top.astro';
---
<Side active="Trips" />
<div class="mk-main">
  <Top title="Marrakesh — 4 nights" sub="MA-0937" crumb="Trips · Booking"><span class="mk-tag amb">Needs you · payment</span></Top>
  <div class="mk-body">
    <div class="mk-msgs">
      <div class="mk-msg"><span class="mk-av">PN</span><div><small class="via">WhatsApp</small><p>Can we make the second night a riad with a rooftop? Otherwise the plan is perfect.</p><small>Priya · yesterday 18:42</small></div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg sys"><span class="mk-av ghost">A</span><div><p>Autopilot asked Atlas Maroc DMC for Dar Zitoune, rooftop room, 10 Feb. Proposal held at v2 until they confirm.</p><small>Automatic</small></div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg"><span class="mk-av ghost">AM</span><div><small class="via">Email</small><p>Confirmed — Dar Zitoune, terrace suite, 10 Feb, same rate. Voucher attached.</p><small>Atlas Maroc DMC · 09:15</small></div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg me"><span class="mk-av">LO</span><div><small class="via">WhatsApp</small><p>Done, Priya — rooftop it is, same price. The updated proposal is on your link.</p><small>You · 09:31 · sent to WhatsApp</small></div></div>
      <div class="mk-msg sys"><span class="mk-av amb">!</span><div><p>Deposit request sent. Marking it received is yours to do — nothing about payment happens silently.</p><small>Human touchpoint</small></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mk-compose"><span>Reply — goes back on the channel it came in on</span><span class="mk-tag grey">WhatsApp</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
